WEBVTT

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:04.563
We needed to understand
where he was coming from.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.663
He was honest and said,
"Look, I'm new to Washington.

00:07:09.697 --> 00:07:14.363
I just transferred here from California
where this law was recently made legal.

00:07:14.363 --> 00:07:17.597
I have never experienced this before.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.730
I need time to think about it.

00:07:19.763 --> 00:07:21.263
No, I won't sign."

00:07:22.897 --> 00:07:26.330
He looked at my sisters and I
to back him up.

00:07:27.263 --> 00:07:29.297
And we looked at our mom

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.597
and she was overcome
with disappointment and burst into tears.